§ `s 97`

`widow after iddah with certificate` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS FALSE
    `the iddah has expired` IS TRUE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS FALSE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

`divorcee within iddah marrying a new man` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS FALSE
    `the iddah has expired` IS FALSE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS FALSE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

`divorcee within iddah remarrying her last husband` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS TRUE
    `the iddah has expired` IS FALSE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS FALSE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

`divorcee after iddah without papers` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS FALSE
    `the iddah has expired` IS TRUE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS FALSE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS FALSE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

`3 talak back to the same husband directly` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS TRUE
    `the iddah has expired` IS TRUE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS TRUE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

`3 talak back after an intervening marriage` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS TRUE
    `the iddah has expired` IS TRUE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS TRUE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS TRUE

`3 talak to a new man after iddah` MEANS Janda WITH
    `marrying the husband she was last divorced from` IS FALSE
    `the iddah has expired` IS TRUE
    `has produced a qualifying certificate` IS TRUE
    `the divorce was by 3 talak` IS TRUE
    `an intervening marriage was consummated and dissolved` IS FALSE

